&lt;p&gt;A course in the Master of Public Affairs program at the Watson Institute, Brown University. Fall 2026, Thursdays 9:00 to 11:30 am. Students do a piece of policy analysis from start to finish with an AI coding agent alongside them, following the eight steps in Bardach and Patashnik&amp;rsquo;s &lt;em&gt;A Practical Guide for Policy Analysis&lt;/em&gt;, and then treat the regulation of AI as a policy question of its own.&lt;/p&gt;
